# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Single source of truth for the Music Space Doodle video (script + storyboard).

Timing is in bars and beats, never seconds:  "12:3"  = bar 12, beat 3 (1-based, 4 beats per bar)
                                              "12:3.5" = the 8th note after beat 3 ("and" of 3)
An event's `end` is exclusive (gone on that beat).  build.py turns this into seconds for 124 BPM and for any tempo/beat map.

Key words that get colour/size emphasis are wrapped in ⟦ ⟧.  "\n" is a forced line break.
Fonts (role -> file in /tmp/music-space-font-cache):
  D display.ttf (站酷庆科黄油体)  M marker.ttf (霞鹜漫黑)  H hand.ttf (悠哉)  N note.ttf (龙藏体)  L logo.ttf (Luckiest Guy)  G digits.ttf (得意黑)
Sizes (font-size at 1920x1080): XXL 240  XL 180  L 128  M 84  S 56  XS 36
Kinds: 'title' (a narration line; at most 2 on screen), 'label' (stamp/chip/pillar/caption, small), 'note' (handwritten annotation), 'fine' (small print).
"""

